.TH "RECORD\-IMAGE\-SERVICES\.PY" "" "June 2026" ""
.SH "NAME"
\fBrecord\-image\-services\.py\fR
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
\fBrecord\-image\-services\.py\fR
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
\fBrecord\-image\-services\.py\fR queries the RECORD provenance database and produces a Graphviz DOT file visualising service\-level metadata \(em applications, the computers they run on, and the specifications that define them\. It is a narrower counterpart to \fBrecord\-image\-project\.py\fR and \fBrecord\-image\-provenance\.py\fR, focused specifically on the infrastructure and software side of the provenance graph rather than people, studies, or statistical entities\.
.P
The script connects to the database via the \fBssrepi\fR library, calls \fBssrepi\.draw_graph\fR with a fixed set of entity types and their label fields, and writes the result to \fBservices\.dot\fR in the current working directory\.
.P
The graph includes the following entity types, labelled by the specified field:
.TS
allbox;
l l.
Entity type	Label field
\fBApplications\fR	\fBname\fR
\fBComputers\fR	\fBID_COMPUTER\fR
\fBSpecifications\fR	\fBID_SPECIFICATION\fR
.TE
.P
The resulting \fBservices\.dot\fR file can be rendered to an image using Graphviz, for example with \fBdot \-Tpng services\.dot \-o services\.png\fR\.
.SH "OPTIONS"
This script accepts no options or arguments\. The entity types, label fields, and output path are all hard\-coded\.
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
Returns 0 on success\.
.P
Returns non\-zero if:
.IP "\(bu" 4
the \fBssrepi\fR library cannot be imported from \fBlib/\fR; or
.IP "\(bu" 4
a database connection or query error occurs\.
.IP "" 0
.SH "ENVIRONMENT"
The script inherits all database connection environment variables from the \fBssrepi\fR library\. Refer to \fBssrepi\.py\fR for the full list\.
.SH "RETURN VALUE"
Writes the Graphviz DOT representation of the services metadata graph to \fBservices\.dot\fR in the current working directory\. Any existing \fBservices\.dot\fR will be overwritten without warning\.
.SH "EXAMPLES"
Generate the services graph and render it to PNG:
.IP "" 4
.nf
record\-image\-services\.py
dot \-Tpng services\.dot \-o services\.png
.fi
.IP "" 0
.SH "FILES"
.TP
\fBlib/ssrepi\.py\fR
The SSREPI provenance library\. Must be importable as \fBssrepi\fR; the script appends \fBlib\fR to \fBsys\.path\fR before importing, so \fBssrepi\.py\fR must be present in a \fBlib/\fR subdirectory relative to the working directory\.
.TP
\fBservices\.dot\fR
Output Graphviz DOT file written to the current working directory\. Overwritten on each run without warning\.
